{"version":1,"content":"<p>韓國存儲晶片巨頭SK海力士近日對未來數年的存儲市場前景發出預警。公司表示，儘管行業正在積極擴大產能，但在人工智能快速發展的推動下，高性能存儲器需求增長速度仍將超過供給增速，全球存儲晶片短缺現象可能持續至2030年前後。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1584160.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-10-28T09:02:08.224122+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":114,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-28T08:42:08+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-28T08:58:15.396774+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-28T08:58:15.396774+00:00","content_hash":"6f50d04e013aef2bfadda118b9e843b2810163f10f3b40ea1b882737f48925d8","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}